          {
            "ru": "Барсик в школе.",
            "en": "Barsik is at school."
          },
          {
            "ru": "Нина на почте.",
            "en": "Nina is at the post office."
          },
          {
            "ru": "Мы в парке.",
            "en": "We are in the park."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Where to? · Куда?",
        "note": "Use the accusative case for a destination with в or на. Movement alone does not decide the case: walking inside a park is still в парке.",
        "examples": [
          {
            "ru": "Барсик идёт в школу.",
            "en": "Barsik is walking to school."
